0..77 Comment "// A flow between types whose written endpoints disagree with its translator:"
78..159 Comment "// `A ⇝ B` abbreviates `Flow(Type, A, B)`, and `Flow.into` introduces it at the"
160..237 Comment "// translator\'s own domain and codomain, so the relation written backwards is"
238..286 Comment "// refused where the flow is checked against it."
